{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05340","headline":"奉和春日幸望春宫 · 郑愔","name":"奉和春日幸望春宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨跸凌高转翠旌，春楼望远背朱城。\n忽排花上游天苑，却坐云边看帝京。\n百草香心初罥蝶，千林嫩叶始藏莺。\n幸同葵藿倾阳早，愿比盘根应候荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}